{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","终焉圆舞"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","終焉のワルツ"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","奥利安在指定位置召唤魔法细剑，造成多段伤害并击晕敌人。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","指定の位置に魔法のレイピアを召喚し、敵に複数回ダメージを与え、スタンを付与"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","奥利安在指定位置召唤魔法细剑，在1.5秒内快速斩击周围1格的所有敌人，造成8段60% + 10% ATK伤害，随后细剑会引发魔力爆炸，造成420% + 40% ATK伤害并击晕范围内所有敌人3 + 0.3秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","指定の位置に魔法のレイピアを召喚し、1.5秒間、周囲1マス以内の敵全体に素早い斬撃を8回繰り出し、1回につき、60% + 10% ATKのダメージを与える。その後、レイピアは魔力爆発を起こし、範囲内の敵に420% + 40% ATKのダメージを与え、3 + 0.3秒間のスタンを付与"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":42,"end":48,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":73,"end":79,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":96,"end":102,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":58,"end":64,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":106,"end":112,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":126,"end":132,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":39,"end":52,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":69,"end":83,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":55,"end":68,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":102,"end":116,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","细剑斩击伤害提升至70% + 10% ATK，最终魔力爆炸的伤害提升至460% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","斬撃1回ごとのダメージが70% + 10% ATKにUPし、魔力爆発のダメージが460% + 40% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":39,"end":45,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":44,"end":50,"power_type":"ultimate","